Route119_Text_MayIntro:
	.string "MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Where were you? I was\n"
	.string "looking for you!\p"
	.string "How much stronger did you get? Let me\n"
	.string "check!\p"
	.string "Ready? Of course you are! Go!$"

Route119_Text_MayDefeat:
	.string "Achah! {PLAYER}{KUN}, you're strong!\p"
	.string "I was worried you were struggling.$"

Route119_Text_MayPresentForYou:
	.string "MAY: But I had nothing to worry about!\n"
	.string "Keep it up!\p"
	.string "And here! A present!$"

Route119_Text_MayExplainFly:
	.string "MAY: With FLY, your POKéMON carries you\n"
	.string "to any town you've visited.\p"
	.string "You need the FORTREE GYM BADGE for it.\n"
	.string "Don't forget!\p"
	.string "FLY home to LITTLEROOT sometime.\p"
	.string "Your mom is worried, {PLAYER}{KUN}. Or so she\n"
	.string "says.\p"
	.string "See you!$"

Route119_Text_BrendanIntro:
	.string "BRENDAN: {PLAYER}! So this is where\n"
	.string "you've been?\p"
	.string "Let's see how good you got. I'll test\n"
	.string "you!\p"
	.string "Now! Battle!$"

Route119_Text_BrendanDefeat:
	.string "Hmm… You've gotten pretty darn decent.$"

Route119_Text_BrendanIllGiveYouThis:
	.string "BRENDAN: You're good enough to search\n"
	.string "anywhere.\p"
	.string "Here. Try this.$"

Route119_Text_BrendanExplainFly:
	.string "BRENDAN: With FLY, your POKéMON carries\n"
	.string "you to any town you've visited.\p"
	.string "You need the FORTREE GYM BADGE for it.\p"
	.string "Anyway, I've got to go.$"

Route119_Text_ScottWayToGoBeSeeingYou:
	.string "SCOTT: Way to go! That cyclist you beat\n"
	.string "is crying behind a tree. I took pictures.\l"
	.string "Of both of you.\p"
	.string "FORTREE next? I've already been in the\n"
	.string "tree house.$"


Route119_Text_ScottYouWonAtFortreeGym:
	.string "… … … … … … … … … … … Beep!\p"
	.string "SCOTT: Congrats on the FEATHER BADGE.\n"
	.string "Nice outfit today.\p"
	.string "… … … … … … … … … … … Click!$"

Route119_Text_StayAwayFromWeatherInstitute:
	.string "We're on lookout.\p"
	.string "Hey! Stay away from the WEATHER\n"
	.string "INSTITUTE. Not safe.\p"
	.string "We're making sparkling rain.$"

Route119_Text_DontGoNearWeatherInstitute:
	.string "Lookout duty is so boring.\p"
	.string "Hey, you! Don't go near the WEATHER\n"
	.string "INSTITUTE.\p"
	.string "Please. I'll give you a SPA.$"

Route119_Text_ThoughtFlyByCatchingBirdMons:
	.string "I thought you FLY by catching a flock\n"
	.string "of BIRD POKéMON and hanging on to them.\p"
	.string "Turns out there's an HM called FLY!\p"
	.string "My aunt still doesn't believe it. She has\n"
	.string "six WINGULL.$"

Route119_Text_TallGrassSnaresBikeTires:
	.string "Tch… No-go…\p"
	.string "The tall grass snares BIKE tires.\p"
	.string "My STRAVA is ruined.$"

Route119_Text_CanYourMonMakeSecretBase:
	.string "Can your POKéMON use SECRET POWER on a\n"
	.string "big pile of grass and make a SECRET\l"
	.string "BASE?\p"
	.string "My brother lives in one. Rent-free.$"

Route119_Text_RouteSignFortree:
	.string "ROUTE 119\n"
	.string "{RIGHT_ARROW} FORTREE CITY\p"
	.string "The city in the trees. Afraid of\n"
	.string "heights? Too bad.$"

Route119_Text_WeatherInstitute:
	.string "WEATHER INSTITUTE\p"
	.string "Forecast: Unclear.$"

Route119_Text_TrainerTipsDecoration:
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "Up to sixteen decorations fit in a\n"
	.string "SECRET BASE.\p"
	.string "You'll put in one chair and never come\n"
	.string "back.$"

@ Project Grounded: Bug Maniac Timothy (net boven de Mimic Circle) - pollenteam, daarna TM58 Pollen Haze
Route119_EventScript_Timothy::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_TIMOTHY, Route119_Text_TimothyIntro, Route119_Text_TimothyDefeat, Route119_EventScript_TimothyGiveTM
	goto_if_unset FLAG_RECEIVED_TM_POLLEN_HAZE, Route119_EventScript_TimothyGiveTM
	msgbox Route119_Text_TimothyPostBattle, MSGBOX_AUTOCLOSE
	end

Route119_EventScript_TimothyGiveTM::
	msgbox Route119_Text_TimothyGiveTM, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	giveitem ITEM_TM_POLLEN_HAZE
	goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT, FALSE, Common_EventScript_ShowBagIsFull
	setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_TM_POLLEN_HAZE
	msgbox Route119_Text_TimothyAfterTM, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

Route119_Text_TimothyIntro:
	.string "Do you feel it? The itch?\n"
	.string "That's the pollen, friend.\p"
	.string "Every BUG I raise was fed nothing\n"
	.string "but pollen since birth.\p"
	.string "My eyes are swollen shut.\n"
	.string "I have never been happier.$"

Route119_Text_TimothyDefeat:
	.string "Ahh… ahh… AHCHOO!$"

Route119_Text_TimothyGiveTM:
	.string "You beat the pollen. So now you\n"
	.string "must CARRY the pollen.\p"
	.string "Take it. TM58. POLLEN HAZE.$"

Route119_Text_TimothyAfterTM:
	.string "SPREAD THE POLLEN!\n"
	.string "AHCHOOOO!$"

Route119_Text_TimothyPostBattle:
	.string "Antihistamines are a lie told\n"
	.string "by the man.$"

